The Major Axis (Long Arrow): This is the direction of the maximum variance. \
It represents the primary trend in the data.

The Minor Axis (Short Arrow): This is the direction of minimum variance. It \
represents the \"noise\" or the thickness of the correlation.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.979481341477951*^9},ExpressionUUID->"09d0fa83-1403-41d3-9de7-\
ffb91dec0738"],

